{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/sunrise-living-driven-jumeirah-park","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":650,"crm_id":"1113","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Sunrise Living","slug":"sunrise-living-driven-jumeirah-park","display_address":"Jumeirah Park","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Sunrise Valley","price":8930000,"display_price":"8.93M","lattitude":25.0490442,"longitude":55.1654757,"min_bedrooms":5,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Sunrise Living is an exclusive collection of villas located in the picturesque Jumeirah Park neighbourhood. The development features <strong>5-bedroom villas.</strong> Breathtaking architecture, high quality interiors create an unrivalled lifestyle in these villas. Each residence is a perfect blend of contemporary design, luxury and comfort. The villas are stylishly decorated using the latest materials and technology to create a cosy and elegant living space.</p><p>Residents of Sunrise Living can enjoy the high level of service and amenities provided by this project. The complex has recreational areas, children's playgrounds, sports fields, and a green park where you can spend time with family or friends. In addition, due to its prime location in the Jumeirah Park neighbourhood, Sunrise Living residents have easy access to all necessary infrastructure such as schools, shops, restaurants and medical facilities.</p><p>Facilities such as Ibn Battuta Mall, Palm Jumeirah, The Walk JBR are all within a 15-minute drive. Mall of the Emirates, Burj Al Arab and Dubai Mall can be reached in 20 minutes, while Al Maktoum Int'l Airport is approximately 30 minutes away.</p><p>Sunrise Living offers residents the opportunity to enjoy luxurious living in one of Dubai's most prestigious neighbourhoods. It is an ideal place for those who appreciate comfort, quality and a cosy atmosphere in their homes.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1113/images/2024/02/27/OaPnvtHKE6cYISMw2P5b5hEYvcCxqN0MlKDCgtaP.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/27/OaPnvtHKE6cYISMw2P5b5hEYvcCxqN0MlKDCgtaP.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1113/images/2024/02/27/rrtrEVaGJXnJF3qB9RmCteV6g53gEnZKNWZMQiQu.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/27/rrtrEVaGJXnJF3qB9RmCteV6g53gEnZKNWZMQiQu.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1113/images/2024/02/27/Ohc621CRDCZDkVaVWGqV34LLnsJmbywXKUfX8wGU.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/27/Ohc621CRDCZDkVaVWGqV34LLnsJmbywXKUfX8wGU.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1113/images/2024/02/27/oUxSx7NLOHOYxjbSOCK6jgVHC2rHrRfUfiRnEkjG.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/27/oUxSx7NLOHOYxjbSOCK6jgVHC2rHrRfUfiRnEkjG.png","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2739,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/02/27/zLZbKC9sY8V07RPpd8F9pJr9iGKL84Jx8TAZprhJ.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":958,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1498,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"5 Bedroom Villa","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"70/30","payment_plans":[{"id":4996,"title":"10%","description":"On booking"},{"id":5001,"title":"50%","description":"During Construction"},{"id":5002,"title":"30%","description":"On handover"}],"community":"","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":7840,"url":null,"text":"Kids Play Area","type":null,"image":null},{"id":7841,"url":null,"text"